        "created_at": "2013-07-22T00:37:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's also good if you've zapped Apostate with something that lowers his damage (or prevents it entirely), such as a Stun Bolt or Hypersonic Assault - then you'd block both the damage from him <span class=\"bbcode-i\">and</span> Condemnation, since the sword is wielded by him.</p>",
